# Configure Jenkins SSH Build Agents (Slave Nodes) in Stratos DC

## Overview
This task configures three Nautilus Application Servers (`stapp01`, `stapp02`, `stapp03`) as permanent SSH build agent (slave) nodes on the Stratos DC Jenkins controller (`jenkins:8080`). Enabling distributed agent nodes allows Jenkins CI/CD pipelines and automation jobs to execute workloads directly on target application hosts using node-specific labels and isolated remote root workspaces.

