Troubleshooting & Root Cause Resolution
Issue Encountered: Initial SSH connection attempts failed with:

Plaintext
/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/known_hosts [SSH] No Known Hosts file was found at /var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/known_hosts.
Key exchange was not finished, connection is closed.
Root Cause: The SSH launcher defaulted to KnownHostsFileKeyVerificationStrategy, while the jenkins controller user lacked a pre-populated known_hosts file for stapp01–stapp03.

Resolution: Updated Host Key Verification Strategy to Non verifying Verification Strategy across all three nodes and relaunched the agents, establishing immediate SSH sessions and deploying remoting.jar.

